@startuml F7.4-ERRO-02-schema-invalido
title F7.4-ERRO-02 — 422 schema inválido no publish
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RTController" as Ctrl
participant "PublishRequestTypeUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Publicar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /request-types/{id}/publish
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  validate schema
  → sem BEGIN TX
end note
UC --> WebApp: 422 invalid_schema
WebApp --> Admin: erro no editor

@enduml
